      "writtenOn": "2024-04-20T04:45:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some apex libraries have header_abi_checker enabled, which means opt-in. They were tagged with PLATFORM. For example,\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/DnsResolver/Android.bp;l\u003d318\n\nThe properties were written before we implicitly tag all apex libraries with PLATFORM.\n\nThis change differentiates APEX and PLATFORM. Since the apex libraries with header_abi_checker enabled are not real opt-in libraries, they are tagged with APEX. I intend to move the real opt-in dumps to the libraries\u0027 own directories like aosp/3043453.",
      "parentUuid": "92a0226a_875dcbe3",
