      "writtenOn": "2024-04-25T04:05:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, the end goal is to actually *reduce* complexity by making the intentions of generating ABI dumps and checks more explicit for opt-in libs:\n\n* placing only ref dumps for APEX / LLNDK under prebuilts/\n* opt-in libraries must define ref_dump_dir\n* APEX / LLNDK are automatically checked against their reference dump\n* opt-in libs must define header_abi_checker.enabled to enable building sdumps",
